          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "成为 — chéngwéi — \"to become\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "他想成为一个医生 tā xiǎng chéngwéi yí ge yīshēng — He wants to become a doctor."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The new character, in pieces: 成 (chéng) — six strokes: a short bar, a long stroke falling to the left, a small turning hook, the long slanting hook of 我, a short fall and a dot. The next lesson puts it in your hand."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
