              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "成为 (chéngwéi) is built from 成 (chéng) 'to complete' and 为 'to make', both inherited from Middle Chinese, dzyeng and hjwe (Guangyun, in Baxter's transcription), which glosses the first 'to finish' and the second 'to do'."
